# twin_mode2.config -- Algo 6 wav-mode 2 (LID scores the REFERENCE; SAD zero + cleared). LID input 59 > feature width 11 -> :1221 concat is CALLED but takes the EMPTY fallback (SAD outputs cleared, :762-763).
# Derived from lid5.config: Algo_choice 6, wav-mode 0 (SAD BLSTM runs, LID scores
# the SAD classification). Plain SAD path (BLSTM_window 0) + plain LID scoring
# (BLSTM_LID_window 0). The real 33,671-weight SAD net (BLSTM topology) is loaded
# via NNweights_config1.bin; the small LID net (input 11 = feature width, so NO
# concat) uses synthetic weights dumped by the harness.
numOuterThreads 8
numInnerThreads 1
multiConfigResultsOutputFile MultiConfigResults_Plot_worker_1.mat
Display_Height 0
Display_MillisecondsPerPixel 64
Display_WaveAll_Height 50
Display_WaveAll_Width 1000
Display_Output_Directory /tmp/figs
Audio_offset 0
Audio_max_duration 240
Algo_choice 6
BLSTM_decision_thresh_rising 0.6
BLSTM_decision_area_rising 0
BLSTM_decision_thresh_falling 0.4
BLSTM_decision_area_falling 0
BLSTM_windowing_type hHCw
BLSTM_windowing_param 3.714451255350461e-01
BLSTM_convolution_window_type hHCw
BLSTM_convolution_window_size 0
BLSTM_flag_DCOffset false
BLSTM_preemph_ratio -9.700000000000000e-01
